{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_062_flow_matching-title\">Flow Matching</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">在已知 probability path 上回归 velocity（而非 score），再直接积分神经 ODE 完成分布运输。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Trains continuous normalizing flows without ODE simulation by directly regressing the marginal vector field u_t(x) along conditional probability paths.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">源分布样本 x0（通常高斯噪声）与数据样本 x1</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Source prior sample x_0 ~ p_0 and target data sample x_1 ~ p_1 interpolated along a conditional path x_t</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">沿学习 ODE 从源分布运输得到的生成样本</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Samples generated by integrating the learned velocity field dx/dt = v_θ(x_t, t) from t=0 to t=1</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.6</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.02747\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_062_flow_matching')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_062_flow_matching')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Flow Matching original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/3fd67e8c25c23b0b13c3.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.6</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_062_flow_matching\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_062_flow_matching')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_062_flow_matching\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">源噪声 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise x0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">易采样的 base distribution，通常 N(0,I)</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests source prior sample x_0 ~ p_0 and target data sample x_1 ~ p_1 interpolated along a conditional path x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (noise x0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"易采样的 base distribution，通常 N(0,I)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests source prior sample x_0 ~ p_0 and target data sample x_1 ~ p_1 interpolated along a conditional path x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (noise x0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"源噪声 x0\" data-node-name-en=\"noise x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">源噪声 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">易采样的 base distribution，通常 N(0,I)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests source prior sample x_0 ~ p_0 and target data sample x_1 ~ p_1 interpolated along a conditional path x_t and prepares initial tensor representations (noise x0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"训练数据分布中的样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes x1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"数据 x1\" data-node-name-en=\"x1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练数据分布中的样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes x1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"联合抽取 (x0,x1)，决定条件概率路径的配对\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs coupling within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"样本 coupling\" data-node-name-en=\"coupling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">样本 coupling</span><span class=\"lang-en\">coupling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">联合抽取 (x0,x1)，决定条件概率路径的配对</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs coupling within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"构造 x_t 与已知 p_t(x|x1)；直线路径常写 x_t=(1-t)x0+t x1\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"前向概率路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向概率路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">构造 x_t 与已知 p_t(x|x1)；直线路径常写 x_t=(1-t)x0+t x1</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"条件路径的解析 velocity target；训练目标不是 score\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs objective u_t within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"目标速度 u_t\" data-node-name-en=\"objective u_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标速度 u_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective u_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">条件路径的解析 velocity target；训练目标不是 score</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs objective u_t within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"普通 U-Net/Transformer 回归 v_theta(x_t,t)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs velocity field v_theta within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"速度场 v_theta\" data-node-name-en=\"velocity field v_theta\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">速度场 v_theta</span><span class=\"lang-en\">velocity field v_theta</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">普通 U-Net/Transformer 回归 v_theta(x_t,t)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs velocity field v_theta within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最小化 ||v_theta-u_t||^2；无需求解 score 或 likelihood\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs FM within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"FM 回归\" data-node-name-en=\"FM\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">FM 回归</span><span class=\"lang-en\">FM</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最小化 ||v_theta-u_t||^2；无需求解 score 或 likelihood</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs FM within the core probability path velocity ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"dx/dt=v_theta(x,t)，从 t=0 数值积分到 t=1\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"生成 ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成 ODE</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">dx/dt=v_theta(x,t)，从 t=0 数值积分到 t=1</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ODE 终点 x(1)\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces samples generated by integrating the learned velocity field dx/dt = v_θ(x_t, t) from t=0 to t=1 via Synthesized Sample.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_062_flow_matching', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ODE 终点 x(1)</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces samples generated by integrating the learned velocity field dx/dt = v_θ(x_t, t) from t=0 to t=1 via Synthesized Sample.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Flow Matching Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lan